<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Seals Farm Tab1</Major>
    <Description>Simple Tab1 macro to farm in various areas for seals. I personally use it for mushroomon in Silver Lake or Western Village but this will work well in any area with a good clump of digis. Be sure to put a ds healing item on "F6" to ensure your digi does not run out of ds. Also, you may take out all F1 and F2 rows if you would like to simply basic attack.

Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 43 1
Delay 1 ms
